      "created_at": "2014-08-14T19:47:33.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Thanks, folks. Very sorry I can't be there.  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/blush.png?v=9\" title=\":blush:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":blush:\"></p>\n<p>I was surprised how annoyed I was to miss the opening. It's the first time I wasn't there since Gen Con moved to Indy.  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/confused.png?v=9\" title=\":confused:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":confused:\"></p>\n<p>But at least I'm not making everyone else sick…  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"></p>",
