      "id": 114628,
      "name": "Ronway",
      "username": "Ronway",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-08-15T01:33:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Rabit\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/48/5774_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Rabit:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>There are many ways to get you to watch a show, especially one this good (and - unfortunately - short).</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I've seen some episodes, my main problem is I have trouble wanting to sit down and watch full shows. It gets even worse when trying to watch a DVD of a show. It's actually not to watching shows, it's reading aswell. Not just books, comics are included. Last year I got the annual subscription for Marvel Unlimited, after the first month I rarely went on there. Shame really… At least games aren't that way!</p>\n<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Rabit\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/48/5774_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Rabit:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Although getting you to Indy would be an entertaining one.  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=12\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>It certainly would! Then you can witness first hand the chaos that I occasionally unleash when playing Sentinels of the Multiverse! I don't even know what HP is anymore.</p>",
      "post_number": 10,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:46:35.437Z",
