      "raw": "[quote=\"Rabit\"]\n\nThere are many ways to get you to watch a show, especially one this good (and - unfortunately - short).\n\n[/quote]\n\nI&#39;ve seen some episodes, my main problem is I have trouble wanting to sit down and watch full shows. It gets even worse when trying to watch a DVD of a show. It&#39;s actually not to watching shows, it&#39;s reading aswell. Not just books, comics are included. Last year I got the annual subscription for Marvel Unlimited, after the first month I rarely went on there. Shame really... At least games aren&#39;t that way!\n\n[quote=\"Rabit\"]\n\nAlthough getting you to Indy would be an entertaining one.  :wink: \n\n[/quote]\n\nIt certainly would! Then you can witness first hand the chaos that I occasionally unleash when playing Sentinels of the Multiverse! I don&#39;t even know what HP is anymore.",
